Vulnerability Detail
As we can see in the docs, the "I" is the "i" value in here and it is directly related
with the output amount a trader will receive when selling a quote/base token:
Since the price will change, the MEV bot can simply sandwich the tx. Here an
example how it can be executed by a MEV bot:

 function test_Adjusting_I_CanBeFrontrunned() external {
         vm.startPrank(tapir);

            // Buy shares with tapir, 10 - 10
            dai.safeTransfer(address(gsp), 10 * 1e18);
