Result on my side:

    advance to start time
            ✓ reverts without tokens approved for staking
    dmute balance before: 0
    dmute balance after: 576922930658129099273
            ✓ get reward without staking
    dmute balance before: 0
    dmute balance after: 576922912276064160247
