Summary
StakingModule's plugin that turned rogue can deny any attempts of its removal and
can effectively stop the contract, disturbing the whole range of StakingModule
operations.
I.e. if any plugin turns malicious due to bug or upgrade altering its functionality vs
one that was in place as of the time of its addition to StakingModule, such
